Bangun, Galvin.

00:28:28.208 --> 00:28:30.502
Kau memanggilku apa? Kau tak mengenalku!

00:28:34.882 --> 00:28:35.883
Sial.

00:28:56.904 --> 00:28:57.946
Hei.

00:29:03.911 --> 00:29:05.120
