00:29:05.662 --> 00:29:07.497
Hei, Paulie.

00:29:10.626 --> 00:29:13.462
- Tidak.
- Tak apa-apa.

00:29:13.545 --> 00:29:15.464
- Hei. Kau aman.
- Tidak.

00:29:16.173 --> 00:29:17.966
Sial.

00:29:18.050 --> 00:29:20.385
Kukira kau akan senang melihatku.

00:29:20.469 --> 00:29:22.262
Sial. Antar aku pulang, Bobby.

00:29:22.346 --> 00:29:24.515
Taser mengacaukan kepalamu.

00:29:25.474 --> 00:29:26.934
Kau menyetrumku?

00:29:27.017 --> 00:29:28.685
- Aku tak menyetrummu.
- Kenapa kau lakukan itu?

00:29:28.769 --> 00:29:30.562
Aku tak menyetrummu.
